WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.266
Hi! Let me tell you what I could do as a child, and what I can do now.

2
00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:10.549
When I was a child, I couldn't swim.

3
00:00:10.999 --> 00:00:12.949
I was afraid of water!

4
00:00:15.199 --> 00:00:18.589
But I could climb trees and rocks very well.

5
00:00:20.839 --> 00:00:25.855
Now I can swim very well. I swim every morning!

6
00:00:28.105 --> 00:00:32.377
My grandmother is ninety. She can't walk very fast…

7
00:00:32.827 --> 00:00:36.171
…but she can tell amazing stories!

8
00:00:38.421 --> 00:00:41.950
And you? What could you do when you were a child?

